Morphe and ReVanced are separate projects and do not author or publish this repository.
Background playback and remembering live stream positions use native XAX adaptations of
Morphe's behavior (and, for background playback, its structural fingerprints). The build 157 player, caption, dislike,
blacklist and DeArrow features follow Morphe's behavior only. Morphe was originally forked from ReVanced. This project is not Morphe or ReVanced.
The applicable Morphe GPLv3 Section 7 notice is preserved in LICENSES/Morphe-NOTICE.txt
and packaged as res/raw/morphe_notice.txt. No patcher or extension infrastructure is bundled.

No XAX redistribution rights are asserted; external compiler source is not vendored.
The independently authored XAX store is application source, not copied compiler source.

The external BrainfuckCC compiler (formerly brainfuckC) generates packaged native policy libraries. Its generic
JNI bridge is also an external binary input. The inspected MIT notice is preserved in
LICENSES/brainfuckC-MIT.txt. Compiler source and seed executables are not bundled here.
